      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /api/v1/company_information, the same cheap authenticated read used by the pinned credential validator.",
        "Required stored companyDomain interpolates https://{{companyDomain}}.bamboohr.com with allowedHosts *.bamboohr.com (Algolia/Grafana-style). Pinned source rejects full URLs and dotted hosts. Self-hosted and custom CNAME domains are not admitted.",
        "HTTP Basic username is the API key with literal password x, matching official docs and the pinned encoder.",
        "OAuth2 is omitted; this recipe uses API key Basic auth.",
        "The upstream user-agent is not sent.",
        "Native category is productivity (source Productivity/Data: Rust CATEGORIES has no data bucket; this is HRIS, not ats-recruitment)."
